  "intuition": "Compute nonnegative linear weights proportional to normalized cost gap between paired items using the provided cost_a and cost_b tensors, avoiding any dependency on the missing 'pair_idx' key and ensuring stable, instance-local weights.",
  "implementation_hint": {
