  "intuition": "Construct all pairs where one element is preferred over the other based on objective scores, and assign pairwise weights using a softmax over the differences that can emphasize larger score gaps while maintaining non-negativity. This allows the model to focus more on pairs with significant objective differences, thus guiding preference learning with a smooth weighting scheme.",
